      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I assume you open the game then click on another window before it launches. VRChat has always had horrendous mouse capture. To get your mouse back you have to navigate back to the game window and let it finish loading so that you can safely click out of the game. Usually the keyboard shortcut Alt+Tab will let you switch back using the keyboard as your mouse obviously will not work.\n\nVRChat will try to grab your mouse at least three times while its loading in desktop mode. This causes an issue when the game is not in focus as it will just lock your mouse to the centre of your screen for no reason.\n\nIf I have not described your issue, you may want to add more details to help reproduce your problem.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-08-14T18:28:46.061Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes my mouse gets stuck after launching the desktop version of the game. I have to hard reset my PC to fix it. It only happens with VRChat.",
